          ai: 'Game: Big A (打大A). 5 players. 108 cards (2×54). Climbing/shedding. Secret partner via matching Aces. Expose Ace = declarer. Matching Ace holder = secret partner. Both Aces = solo (1v4). Bombs beat all. Score by finish order. Anti-clockwise. Inner Mongolia origin.',
